は、多少の無念もある。 \n此度の生でそれを晴らすことができれば、 \nこの上ない幸甚であろうな。","welcome":"日の本を統べし天下人が一人……織田信長だ。 \n噂に名高き『殿』とは貴様のことか？ \nいかほどの器か、見定めてやろう。 \n無様を晒すようなら、予がとって喰らうが……構わぬな？","raw":{"CardID":7727,"ClassID":100,"SubClassID":7729,"Rarity":7,"CardCategory":5,"VoiceID":4013,"AreaType":7,"FavoriteThings":1,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":116,"AttackCorrection":128,"DefenseCorrection":116,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":16,"GrowUpLimitType":1001,"AbilityID":7727,"OrganizedAbilityID":7727,"AlwaysAbilityID":7727,"GimmickID":7727,"SpecialAbilityID":7727,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"ExclusionVote":1,"DependenceCardId":7728,"AutoProtect":1,"Sequence":300}}